 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS X-Ray API (2016-04-12). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Groups are stored metadata: no trace segment or telemetry is accepted, filter expressions are stored without parsing or evaluation, and no insight or insight notification is generated. The implicit Default group is not listed. Traces, service graphs, statistics, insights, trace retrieval, segment destinations, indexing rules and resource policies return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Sampling rules and the encryption configuration are not implemented: a sampling rule record nests its identity inside SamplingRule, and an encryption configuration switched back to NONE would keep its key, which the bounded model cannot represent. ListTagsForResource refuses NextToken.",
  "title": "AWS X-Ray (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2016-04-12"
 },
